y time, no two runs look the same.\n\nCombat is fast and arcade-like, with lots of dodging and a steady stream of projectiles, and a run can be finished in under an hour. It is a single-player game that rewards learning enemies and trying new builds. Ziggurat suits players who like quick shooters with roguelike progression."}}